    <briefdescription>
<para>Display information for a callgraph. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Extends the <ref refid="classDisplayGraph" kindref="compound">DisplayGraph</ref> class to build display a <ref refid="classCallGraph" kindref="compound">CallGraph</ref> The class is written in a way that partial callgraphs can be displayed i.e. beginning from a node, all nodes are added with have a distance (measured in edges) nearer than a threshold </para>    </detaileddescription>
